{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32246","headline":"西江上送渔父 · 温庭筠","name":"西江上送渔父","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"却逐严光向若耶，钓轮菱櫂寄年华。\n三秋梅雨愁枫叶，一夜篷舟宿苇花。\n不见水云应有梦，偶随鸥鹭便成家。\n白苹风起楼船暮，江燕双双五两斜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32246.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32246","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}